    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_752_1#8$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar",
        "text": "Ah, so that was it! Of course my little Smithy would be able to craft a Dung Bomb from droppings so quickly!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar",
        "text": "If you throw a Dung Bomb onto a monster, they won't be able to stand the smell and will run away from mew, just like us with Noir Corne earlier."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_500_noirc_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne",
        "text": "Hey, no using me as an example!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_502_Yato_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yato",
        "text": "Even though they changed directions, they're still rampaging through the forest. This will be troublesome if the Rathalos tracks get trampled over."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_500_noirc_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne",
        "text": "Rampaging hornbeasts... I feel like that's definitely out of the ordinary. Why would they go berserk for no reason?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_502_Yato_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yato",
        "text": "It doesn't matter, we just need to stop them."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_752_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar",
        "text": "With my expurrtise, I postulate that there must be a lead hornbeast at the front to make such a huge herd move like that."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_502_Yato_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yato",
        "text": "Really now? If that's the case, then we'll just have to cut it down."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_500_noirc_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne",
        "text": "Wait, what do you mean by 'just have to cut it down'?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_502_Yato_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yato",
        "text": "What part of that was hard to understand?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_500_noirc_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne",
        "text": "And how exactly do you plan to do that, huh?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_502_Yato_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yato",
        "text": "Just charge right in."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_500_noirc_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne",
        "text": "There's so many of them and they're all in a frenzy... You sure about that? We don't even know why they're going crazy."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_502_Yato_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yato",
        "text": "And will they wait for us to sit down and figure out the cause? Cover me."
