            "name": "avg_502_Yato_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yato",
        "text": "Got it."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_752_1#8$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar",
        "text": "Sure enough, the herd has calmed down quite a bit."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_500_noirc_1",
            "name2": "avg_502_Yato_1#4$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yato",
        "text": "Corne, you..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_500_noirc_1",
            "name2": "avg_502_Yato_1#4$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne",
        "text": "Yes, I know! I stink like hell, I'll get away from you guys!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_500_noirc_1",
            "name2": "avg_502_Yato_1#4$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "playmusic",
        "params": {
            "intro": "$warm_intro",
            "key": "$warm_loop",
            "volume": 0.6
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yato",
        "text": "No, you're hurt."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_500_noirc_1",
            "name2": "avg_502_Yato_1#4$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne",
        "text": "Oh, this scratch? It's nothing."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_500_noirc_1",
            "name2": "avg_502_Yato_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "characteraction",
        "params": {
            "name": "right",
            "type": "move",
            "x": -50,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_500_noirc_1",
            "name2": "avg_502_Yato_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yato",
        "text": "It's a good thing I had a spare first aid kit. Come over here and I'll take care of it."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_500_noirc_1",
            "name2": "avg_502_Yato_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne",
        "text": "Ah... O-Okay."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_752_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar",
        "text": "Come over quick, the two of mew."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar",
        "text": "See here? The nose of the lead beast has traces of a grayish white dust here."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_500_noirc_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne",
        "text": "Uh, this looks familiar..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_752_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar",
        "text": "Back home, there is a species of fauna known as a Stinkmink that can release a cloud of pheromones, sending meownsters into a frenzy and charging straight into mew."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_752_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar",
        "text": "Our Hunters make use of that effect in their hunts."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_500_noirc_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne",
        "text": "Ah, now I remember... I saw bottles of this stuff at that Kashiwau's place, could it be...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_752_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar",
        "text": "I'm pawsitive."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_500_noirc_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne",
        "text": "Did he know we entered the forest and agitate the hornbeasts with the dust to cut us off?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne",
        "text": "He <i>did</i> say 'Don't ever let me see you there\u2014'"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_502_Yato_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yato",
        "text": "No, that can't be it."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_500_noirc_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne",
        "text": "Huh?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_502_Yato_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yato",
        "text": "He was already in the forest by yesterday afternoon, while we only arrived here after the incident in the cave, so he shouldn't know our whereabouts."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yato",
        "text": "He couldn't have seen us in the forest either; there's no way I wouldn't have spotted him first."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_500_noirc_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne",
        "text": "True enough, and I guess if his motive was to find the Rathalos, he wouldn't want to risk losing its tracks either, by triggering such a stampede."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne",
        "text": "Lemme think... Or maybe he planned to do something else with the herd, but lost control of it?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_502_Yato_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yato",
        "text": "...You're thinking about pointless things again. We have a beast to track."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$MH_nekoinjured"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar",
        "text": "This is bad! Smithy's gone again!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar",
        "text": "We were together in the tree earlier, but when we came down..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_500_noirc_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne",
        "text": "Ahhh! I won't go through that ever again... never!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$MH_nekotalk",
            "volume": 0.4
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Artisan",
        "text": "Mrrow..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_500_noirc_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne",
        "text": "I think I heard a Felyne over there."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar",
        "text": "Ah! Smithy! What happened to mew?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_500_noirc_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne",
        "text": "Seems like... he got stunned by the stink."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_502_Yato_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yato",
        "text": "...I can only hope this will be the worst of it."
    },
